Lantern Mothkeeper — complete and playable

**Summary:** Small browser arcade (plain HTML/CSS/JS, no external assets). Lantern follows arrow keys/WASD + mouse/touch/pointer with velocity clamp and glow pulse. Golden moths within `lantern.glow+70` are attracted, slowed inside inner glow for capture (+10 + combo +2 per 3). Storm sparks accelerate with difficulty (0.95s→0.4s spawn), hit gives -7, shake, flash, stun 0.22s and hitCooldown 0.9s. 60s timer with timeBar warning <12s, score/best HUD, particles. Start/pause/game-over overlays, restart via R/Space/buttons and **tap-anywhere on shell** (critic fix vs Flappy/Suika bar for instant replay). Responsive `aspect-ratio 800/560` canvas, mobile touch drag, vignette/starfield polish.

**Public game link:** `https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AgentsLoop/PlayGround/16a19df600a326542b9cf087e85a40e1a463ace6/index.html` (open directly) and local `http://127.0.0.1:3000/index.html` via tmux `app-server` on port 3000. Pages deployment will be handled by workflow (gh-pages).

**Final commit:** https://github.com/AgentsLoop/PlayGround/commit/16a19df600a326542b9cf087e85a40e1a463ace6
