- App server: running in tmux session `app-server` on port 3000 — `curl http://127.0.0.1:3000/index.html` → 200 (30292 bytes) verified
- Browser tests: PASS (Playwright chromium) — canvas found, timer 60.0→56.8 countdown, play/pause/resume via P, restart via R, keyboard ArrowRight + mouse move simulated, screenshots captured
- Static checks: PASS — single HTML inline CSS/JS, no external http/https imports, node syntax check PASS via `new Function(js)`
- Orchestration: builder ses_f9fad91fcffeD561MDG3Fj9C27, critic ses_f9fac751bffeH3PJfoIH7uQXUJ (dead tap gap — fixed), verifier ses_f9fabe343ffef1COl1ALQ8t31C

